WEBVTT

00:06:29.715 --> 00:06:32.465
I think that really is one 
of the most important reasons

00:06:32.465 --> 00:06:38.505
for success of our countrymen not only
in Silicon Valley but all over the world.

00:06:38.505 --> 00:06:41.405
That's a good thought 
and this is coming from Sundar himself

00:06:41.405 --> 00:06:43.995
who has seen the world
from very different eyes,

00:06:43.995 --> 00:06:47.805
from a very different perspective
that we can only imagine.

00:06:47.805 --> 00:06:50.235
Taking his example,

00:06:50.235 --> 00:06:54.525
many amongst you can become
like Sundar Pichai.

00:06:54.525 --> 00:06:57.065
Hopefully, God willing, one day.

00:06:57.065 --> 00:07:00.535
(Applause)